        "observed": "Inspected complete 960×960 winter exterior from the northwest. Broad gold onion dome; two tall pale minarets with stacked octagonal turquoise-window tiers, projecting cornices/parapets and gilded pointed cones. Smaller golden onion turret and teal roof caps, pale grey masonry and tall turquoise pointed window fields. Snow, street buildings, lighting and fine calligraphy are not copied. The separate low northern building remains host context."
